# Netlify Redirects & API Proxy Configuration

# Rule 1: Proxy API requests to the Render backend service (same-origin to browser, preserves HTTP-only cookies)
# NOTE: Replace '<YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE>' with your actual Render service name before deployment
/api/*  https://<YOUR-RENDER-SERVICE>.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# Rule 2: Single Page Application (SPA) fallback to index.html for client-side routing
/*      /index.html  200
